4. Data Retention and Account Deletion
Retention: User profile data (email address and device hash) is retained for as long as you maintain an active account to manage your access rights and prevent trial abuse.
Account & Data Deletion: You have the right to request the complete deletion of your account and all associated backend records. To request deletion, email kentbanks96@gmail.com with the subject line "Account Deletion Request". Your account and associated records will be permanently deleted within a reasonable timeframe.
Local Data Deletion: You can delete all locally stored transaction logs and shortcuts at any time by clearing the app data in Android settings or uninstalling the app.
5. Children's Privacy

The Application is not directed toward children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under 13. If we discover that a child under 13 has provided personal details, we will promptly delete that information from our servers. Parents or guardians may contact us at kentbanks96@gmail.com to report any such concerns.

6. Security

We take reasonable technical, physical, and procedural precautions to protect your information against unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure. All communication between the app and backend services is encrypted using industry-standard TLS/SSL protocols.

